R(n,m):=if n=0 then 1 else if n<m then 0 else if n=m then (n-1)! else R(n,m+1)+binomial(n,m)*(m-1)!*R(n-m,m);
makelist(R(n,1),n,0,21); /* _Vladimir Kruchinin_, Sep 09 2014 */

